  "releaseNotes": "Loam 3.13.0: Loam.Pickers DatePicker editable text entry — set Editable to type a date into the field; committed on Enter/blur, parsed against DateFormat then loosely, validated against MinDate/MaxDate (InvalidDateText on failure). The trailing calendar icon becomes a button (Alt+Down also opens) and the flyout stays in sync. Public static TryParseDate exposes the parse rule. Additive, off by default. See https://araxis.github.io/loam/guide/changelog",
